<title>UK: Northern Rock sets 50 million stg three-year FRN. [CORRECTED 11:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Northern Rock sets 50 million stg three-year FRN. [CORRECTED 11:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORTHERN ROCK BUILDING SOCIETE</p>
<p> AMT    50 MLN STG    BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    10.JUL.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  99.964    FULL FEES   10 BP</p>
<p>(Corrects issue price from 99.864)</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    GOV LAW    ENGLISH   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
